SUMMARY:Lavender and Blooms Floral Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Lavender & Blooms Floral Workshop in Davis  June 6 Session 1: 11:00 AM Session 2: 1:00 PM\nCelebrate lavender season with an afternoon of creativity\, flowers\, and vineyard charm!\nJoin us for our Lavender & Blooms Floral Workshop\, a relaxed and social experience set against the beautiful backdrop of Great Bear Vineyards. More than just a floral class\, this is an opportunity to sip\, create\, connect\, and enjoy a wonderful day with friends surrounded by blooming lavender and stunning vineyard views.\n Choose the session that works best for you—11 AM or 1 PM—and settle in for a hands-on workshop led by the talented team at Zeeba Blooms. You’ll create your own lavender-inspired floral arrangement using fragrant lavender and fresh seasonal blooms\, crafting a beautiful piece to take home and enjoy.\nWhether you’re a flower enthusiast\, looking for a unique outing\, or simply want an excuse to spend the day at the vineyard\, this experience is designed to be fun\, welcoming\, and inspiring for everyone.\n Your Ticket Includes: A guided\, hands-on floral workshop featuring lavender and seasonal blooms A beautifully styled workshop setup designed to enhance the vineyard experience A dedicated floral photo moment with Zeeba Blooms styling and branding—perfect for capturing memories with your creation\n Pair your afternoon with a wine tasting\, stroll through the lavender fields\, and soak in the beauty of Lavender Weekend while creating something truly special.\nGather your friends\, unleash your creativity\, and join us for an unforgettable afternoon filled with flowers\, friendship\, and a little lavender magic.
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/lavender-and-blooms-floral-workshop/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-1-oPvBGZ.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
