SUMMARY:Lavender Festival at Great Bear Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Lavender Festival at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis  Saturday\, June 6 $10 per person | Children $5\nRelax. Breathe. Bloom.\nSpend a beautiful day surrounded by blooming lavender\, vineyard views\, local artisans\, live music\, delicious treats\, and award-winning wine at our annual Lavender Festival!\nJust minutes from downtown Davis\, this charming mini-festival celebrates everything we love about summer—lavender\, honey\, flowers\, food\, wine\, and time spent with friends and family. Wander through fragrant lavender fields\, enjoy live music\, browse local vendors\, and experience the beauty of Great Bear Vineyards at the height of lavender season.\n Festival Hours: 11 AM–3 PM Winery Open: 11 AM–5 PM for wine\, wine tasting\, and vineyard enjoyment Yoga in the Lavender Fields: 9:30–10:30 AM Lavender Brunch: 10:30 AM–12:30 PM (Advance reservations required — this event sells out every year!)\n What’s Included with Your $10 Ticket? One freshly harvested lavender bunch to take home Access to the Lavender Festival and lavender fields Endless photo opportunities among the blooming lavender\n Children’s Ticket – $5 Includes one scoop of Davis Creamery’s special Honey Lavender Ice Cream—cool\, creamy\, and floral perfection!\n Live MusicEnjoy performances by GOTZ from 1–2 PM and 3–4 PM.\nA singer-songwriter from Davis\, GOTZ blends Country\, Folk\, and Americana influences into songs inspired by love\, loss\, resilience\, and life’s winding journey. His debut album Long Dormant Dreams is available on all major streaming platforms.\n Taste\, Browse & Shop Sample and purchase local honey from The Hive Browse handcrafted lavender soaps\, lip balms\, and candles from Capay Valley Lavender Farm Shop beautiful floral arrangements and bouquets from Zeeba Blooms Explore Great Bear’s handmade lavender wreaths\, lavender oil\, apparel\, corkscrews\, and more Enjoy freshly picked seasonal fruit from our orchard Treat yourself to Honey Lavender Ice Cream from Davis Creamery\n Optional Extras Wine by the glass to enjoy among the vines Wine flights featuring five award-winning wines Cheese\, salami\, crackers\, and picnic snacks Lavender Brunch (advanced reservations required)\nWhether you’re looking for a peaceful escape\, a fun outing with friends\, a family-friendly adventure\, or simply an excuse to spend a day surrounded by the sweet scent of lavender\, this is one of the most beautiful weekends of the year at Great Bear Vineyards.\nGather your friends\, bring your camera\, and join us as we celebrate the bloom of summer!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/lavender-festival-at-great-bear-vineyards/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards 24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled-zK0eUQ.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
